      "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why do humans dream of space exploration? What if that dream goes wrong?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1424290/extras/aa226bf8827853963c8028e386a96a09.poster.avif?t=1771976435\" width=612 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1424290/extras/aa226bf8827853963c8028e386a96a09.webm?t=1771976435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1424290/extras/aa226bf8827853963c8028e386a96a09.mp4?t=1771976435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Sgt. Anna &quot;Thirteen&quot; Charlotte on a space mission to the first human colony on Mars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > With the use of special abilities tied to elements like ice, fire, and electricity help her navigate the colony and battle through the Mars's secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1424290/extras/9d0adcb59a39ec708dafb5738dfef015.poster.avif?t=1771976435\" width=616 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1424290/extras/9d0adcb59a39ec708dafb5738dfef015.webm?t=1771976435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1424290/extras/9d0adcb59a39ec708dafb5738dfef015.mp4?t=1771976435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MARS 2120</strong> is a metroidvania with engaging melee combat inspired by classics like <i>Super Metroid</i>, <i>Castlevania: Symphony of the Night</i>, or <i>Guacamelee!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1424290/extras/3620bc3ec0bb59b602f5ea012ce745e4.poster.avif?t=1771976435\" width=612 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1424290/extras/3620bc3ec0bb59b602f5ea012ce745e4.webm?t=1771976435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1424290/extras/3620bc3ec0bb59b602f5ea012ce745e4.mp4?t=1771976435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Key Features:</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Martian colony:</strong> discover new biomes, secrets, and numerous threats along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face your enemies:</strong> perform combos by mixing melee and ranged attacks, as well as special moves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use different equipment and abilities:</strong> find upgrades and new skills while exploring the Martian colony.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage in epic battles:</strong> from deadly robots to colossal monsters, build your strategies, uncover their weaknesses, and survive!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play it your way:</strong> with various accessibility options, you can customize the game according to your style and needs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1424290/extras/951c28275ec0abeaffa3a08122bf08d2.poster.avif?t=1771976435\" width=616 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1424290/extras/951c28275ec0abeaffa3a08122bf08d2.webm?t=1771976435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1424290/extras/951c28275ec0abeaffa3a08122bf08d2.mp4?t=1771976435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
      "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why do humans dream of space exploration? What if that dream goes wrong?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1424290/extras/aa226bf8827853963c8028e386a96a09.poster.avif?t=1771976435\" width=612 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1424290/extras/aa226bf8827853963c8028e386a96a09.webm?t=1771976435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1424290/extras/aa226bf8827853963c8028e386a96a09.mp4?t=1771976435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Sgt. Anna &quot;Thirteen&quot; Charlotte on a space mission to the first human colony on Mars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > With the use of special abilities tied to elements like ice, fire, and electricity help her navigate the colony and battle through the Mars's secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1424290/extras/9d0adcb59a39ec708dafb5738dfef015.poster.avif?t=1771976435\" width=616 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1424290/extras/9d0adcb59a39ec708dafb5738dfef015.webm?t=1771976435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1424290/extras/9d0adcb59a39ec708dafb5738dfef015.mp4?t=1771976435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MARS 2120</strong> is a metroidvania with engaging melee combat inspired by classics like <i>Super Metroid</i>, <i>Castlevania: Symphony of the Night</i>, or <i>Guacamelee!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1424290/extras/3620bc3ec0bb59b602f5ea012ce745e4.poster.avif?t=1771976435\" width=612 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1424290/extras/3620bc3ec0bb59b602f5ea012ce745e4.webm?t=1771976435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1424290/extras/3620bc3ec0bb59b602f5ea012ce745e4.mp4?t=1771976435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Key Features:</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Martian colony:</strong> discover new biomes, secrets, and numerous threats along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face your enemies:</strong> perform combos by mixing melee and ranged attacks, as well as special moves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use different equipment and abilities:</strong> find upgrades and new skills while exploring the Martian colony.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage in epic battles:</strong> from deadly robots to colossal monsters, build your strategies, uncover their weaknesses, and survive!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play it your way:</strong> with various accessibility options, you can customize the game according to your style and needs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1424290/extras/951c28275ec0abeaffa3a08122bf08d2.poster.avif?t=1771976435\" width=616 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1424290/extras/951c28275ec0abeaffa3a08122bf08d2.webm?t=1771976435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1424290/extras/951c28275ec0abeaffa3a08122bf08d2.mp4?t=1771976435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
      "short_description": "Metroidvania with a mix of melee and ranged combats inspired by classics like Super Metroid, Castlevania: Symphony of the Night or Guacamelee! Help Anna “Thirteen” Charlotte battle her way through the secrets of Mars.",
      "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
      "reviews": "“After playing and replaying a few times, I found a game that demonstrates maturity in its design choices and mechanics. In its current development stage, I found very conscious decisions of what the game wants to be.  Naturally, there is still much to be done and improved, but MARS 2120 has great potential. The basic structures of a good metroidvania are all here, competently implemented.”<br>Game Lodge<br><br>“In simple terms, Mars is the Brazilian Super Metroid, capable of reproducing the qualities of the Nintendo franchise very well, especially in its aesthetics and setting, which complement each other optimally, building the idea of mystery that leads players to continue exploring to understand what is happening - this atmosphere of mystery, in fact, is reminiscent of Metroid Dread.”<br>O MEGASCOPIO<br>",
      "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1424290/cefaaa4dd4c7a6e8179bdc9a085b0c2e96f4e164/header.jpg?t=1771976435",
